{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_06", "source_id": "695e0b89000000001a031913", "title": "无废话纯分享 12年油痘肌2025空瓶大赏", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695e0b89000000001a031913", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 2484, "evidence_unit_count": 75, "original_evidence_unit_count": 75, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 256, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 大家二五年度空屏报告来喽 我真的没想到竟然会有这么的多", "多酸精华现在是我家庭班 腰配酸 第二天早上起来那个皮肤真的很嫩很嫩", "这个我每年冬天都会回购的 这个色修面霜 我在春天夏天 真的很喜欢用它", "感觉它在帮我充电 心情特别的好 这个我已经回购 它三四次了", "而且它是项目之后也可以用的 其实我应该用了不止一瓶 然后还有其他的有的时候 用完顺手就扔掉了", "就用完之后头发挺柔顺的 但是我应该不会回购了 就是再看看其他的", "如果价钱合适 我也还是会回购它的 包卖霜是我在秋冬天 一定会拿出来用的面霜"], "retained_quotes": ["就用完之后头发挺柔顺的 但是我应该不会回购了 就是再看看其他的", "如果价钱合适 我也还是会回购它的 包卖霜是我在秋冬天 一定会拿出来用的面霜"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695e0b89000000001a031913/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695e0b89000000001a031913/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695e0b89000000001a031913/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695e0b89000000001a031913/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "f0cdc89d2d704d5ca3fdc99d9e55abe527cd7868c95b30f9a05a8c984b9bb9a8", "card_hash": "8c7695b8ef971531ef0ab19ad0bb154df2dd9021837bb27dc8636cdcf3190727", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_06", "source_id": "695a2561000000001f0096c0", "title": "经常用酸的好处", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695a2561000000001f0096c0", "topic_family": "刷酸与焕肤", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 929, "evidence_unit_count": 27, "original_evidence_unit_count": 27, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["用了5年酸，没有出现皮肤越来越薄、越来越敏的情况，反而柔嫩平滑细腻有光泽，谁都看不出我是12年油痘肌✌️真的非常建议油痘肌姐妹把酸用起来", "酸的效果就相当于逐渐把脸上的死皮弄掉 3、皮肤吸收力特别好", "#油痘肌护肤[话题]# #痘痘闭口[话题]# #闭口[话题]# #如何拯救痘痘肌[话题]#", "Ordinary. TAKAMI STEP3", "常用的酸~ 贵的平价的都有，效果都很好", "然后很多女生，脸颊颧骨那里，都挺薄，我之前用酸就总是那块不耐受，后来我干脆用酸的时候就避开那片，就基本没翻车过了～", "最后说一下，酸得选合适自己的，不需要卷高浓度，刚开始用一定从低浓度开始建立耐受"], "retained_quotes": ["然后很多女生，脸颊颧骨那里，都挺薄，我之前用酸就总是那块不耐受，后来我干脆用酸的时候就避开那片，就基本没翻车过了～", "最后说一下，酸得选合适自己的，不需要卷高浓度，刚开始用一定从低浓度开始建立耐受"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695a2561000000001f0096c0/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695a2561000000001f0096c0/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695a2561000000001f0096c0/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_695a2561000000001f0096c0/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "19997e4a3cdfb4c8d7606067f4bdb650520e1249094fe2a80e48b32ca75f6b4e", "card_hash": "22edfca948097f480149f5290576ecad65109247622333d5f6e6790f3f926740", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_06", "source_id": "694e7815000000001f00e629", "title": "垮脸跟练！3min速速回春的胶原按摩法", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694e7815000000001f00e629", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1507, "evidence_unit_count": 45, "original_evidence_unit_count": 45, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 134, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["哈嘍大家 最近找房搬家要熬了几个大夜 都没有时间 好不服了", "敷在这种油脂很厚的区域 先把这个油脂转化了 我一般还会配合一个热喷", "而且它润而不油 做妆前就很服贴 一整天都不会紧繃卡粉 那我一般先用一个精华稍微打个底", "把胶圆补进去 像我们去美容院的话 它其实也是这个流程来帮我们操作", "因为今天整个人的是往上走的 戳起来也是QQ谈谈的", "好 我飞花不多说了 马上开始 因为我是油皮 所以我会先打开皮肤通道", "油皮如果想要好皮肤 第一步就是要做好书通 后续的护肤品才可以被我们的皮肤吸收进去"], "retained_quotes": ["好 我飞花不多说了 马上开始 因为我是油皮 所以我会先打开皮肤通道", "油皮如果想要好皮肤 第一步就是要做好书通 后续的护肤品才可以被我们的皮肤吸收进去"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694e7815000000001f00e629/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694e7815000000001f00e629/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694e7815000000001f00e629/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694e7815000000001f00e629/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "16c3256f11d65d34b6bd767efd6f20e67146be6b09a86410aa37ad5aeac3f3c8", "card_hash": "73c56f7a662a040a33ab9061cbdbdc6ec0774ca5b594e588497451c798384f6c", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_06", "source_id": "6950aad8000000001e035c17", "title": "怒花几千块总结的大实话！oy好物歹物全分享", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6950aad8000000001e035c17", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 2955, "evidence_unit_count": 92, "original_evidence_unit_count": 92, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 345, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["哈喽哈喽 这次我在奥利比亚疯狂采购的一版 这些全部都是我花钱卖出来的大实话", "首先就是这个粉撲 我给它取名叫 艾玛士粉撲 应该是那一面墙的粉撲里面最贵的", "它的定妆效果 非常扭的 真的心服口服 化妆老师那天给我用了它", "就真的挑不出一点毛病 我再来说一个 最好用的东西 是一瓶发油", "就不怎么出彩 但是也不怎么难用", "我第二天直接冲出去 回购了几个送朋友 再就是一个这个东西", "我每次用完眼睛都是酸酸的 色色的 然后会出很多红血丝 再就是这个泥膜"], "retained_quotes": ["我第二天直接冲出去 回购了几个送朋友 再就是一个这个东西", "我每次用完眼睛都是酸酸的 色色的 然后会出很多红血丝 再就是这个泥膜"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6950aad8000000001e035c17/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6950aad8000000001e035c17/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6950aad8000000001e035c17/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6950aad8000000001e035c17/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "7cee20598bbc698131a0a777c28047f365b24ff788ea52d53a76a82b1bda1c68", "card_hash": "997adaa51e7e8386ed254da73c5d18478b8631d22df66c086ec31baf36c8a857", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_06", "source_id": "694bbef3000000001f007a58", "title": "油皮去黄找对思路其实就是顺手的事", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694bbef3000000001f007a58", "topic_family": "提亮与肤色", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 837, "evidence_unit_count": 25, "original_evidence_unit_count": 25, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 75, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["有沒有姐妹跟我之前一樣 早上洗完臉 整個皮膚看起來還是很白淨透亮的", "我覺得它是能同時滿足這三個的 其實我在三年前就已經分享過它", "然後在額頭鼻翼嘴角這種容易角質堆積 暗沉出油的地方再疊加一層", "我臉上是有那個皮膚 當時就是維持了很久 我整個皮膚狀態看起來很差", "再去進間 只要皮膚勻靜通透起來 就會顯得整個人的氣色 氣質都會很好", "它上臉的時候看著是有油光 但是是秒吸收的非常的清爽 我一般就是晚上用先全臉塗一遍", "所以用酸小白 你用它之前第一次的話 可以先在舉步先試一試"], "retained_quotes": ["它上臉的時候看著是有油光 但是是秒吸收的非常的清爽 我一般就是晚上用先全臉塗一遍", "所以用酸小白 你用它之前第一次的話 可以先在舉步先試一試"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694bbef3000000001f007a58/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694bbef3000000001f007a58/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694bbef3000000001f007a58/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_694bbef3000000001f007a58/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "5c4589725933b5dc0acf61c6e91c4b78d346a5d629c6a32469d63943d0fdf257", "card_hash": "34403d05fa50077fb00bcf700a4a2e8899273dd500f8b165f227e9d3b8900623", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
